{"seq":1,"slug":"logic-and-metaphysics","title":"Logic And Metaphysics","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/major-works/logic-and-metaphysics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-organon-works","title":"《工具论》诸篇","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/major-works/logic-and-metaphysics/the-organon-works","wordCount":1679,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-metaphysics-work","title":"《形而上学》","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/aristotle/major-works/logic-and-metaphysics/the-metaphysics-work","wordCount":1517,"readingTime":7}],"introHtml":"<p>本章考察亚里士多德在逻辑与形而上学领域的奠基性著作。《工具论》是其逻辑著作的总集，以三段论为核心，奠定了西方形式逻辑的基础，在两千多年里一直是逻辑学的标准。《形而上学》则探讨&quot;存在之为存在&quot;这一最根本的问题，建立了关于实体、形式与质料、第一推动者的学说，开创了&quot;形而上学&quot;这门学科。本章揭示这两部奠基性经典的深远意义。</p>\n"}